+ * Read a DOM boundary as an offset into the host's flattened text, in UTF-16 code units.
+ *
+ * Selection anchor and focus can be in different text nodes, so callers must measure each endpoint
+ * independently rather than using a Range's ordered start/end as if it preserved selection direction.
